    "Receipt parsing uses callback epoch milliseconds, not calendar getTimeStamp or later consumer time. Reported time after arrival is refused even if it precedes later processing time.",
    "The journal checks source after resource locking and in Spring beforeCommit. Invalidated source rolls back the SQL event and command-version update.",
